<section id="pollution-types" style="padding: 30px; background-color: #f0f8ff">
  <h2 style="color: #1b4332; margin-bottom: 20px">
    📌 Major Types of Pollution
  </h2>
  <ul
    style="list-style-type: none; padding: 0; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #34495e"
  >
    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <strong>Air Pollution</strong> – Caused by industrial emissions, vehicle
      exhaust, and deforestation.
    </li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <strong>Water Pollution</strong> – Due to plastic waste, oil spills, and
      chemical dumping in water bodies.
    </li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <strong>Soil Pollution</strong> – Resulting from pesticides, landfills,
      and hazardous waste disposal.
    </li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <strong>Noise Pollution</strong> – Caused by urbanization, traffic, and
      industrial activities.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
